  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h1 data-lake-id=\"6039760b\" id=\"6039760b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u88db1ea8\" id=\"u88db1ea8\">数据预处理</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"ufbe5ee34\" id=\"ufbe5ee34\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"a4d3b02a\" id=\"a4d3b02a\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua3c00c69\" id=\"ua3c00c69\">概述</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ud4271e54\" id=\"ud4271e54\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u05fb6f85\" id=\"u05fb6f85\"><span data-lake-id=\"u520bdf69\" id=\"u520bdf69\">torchvision.transform是一个包含了常用图像变化方法的工具包. 该工具包主要用于图像的预处理,数据增强等工作之中. 本节我们将详细介绍torchvision.transforms中常用的数据处理函数</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u09aded9b\" id=\"u09aded9b\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7601bce5\" id=\"u7601bce5\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua35c71ea\" id=\"ua35c71ea\">知识点:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3fdcb560\" id=\"u3fdcb560\"><br></p><ol list=\"u460ae1aa\"><li fid=\"u50b6f51f\" data-lake-id=\"u2618ff45\" id=\"u2618ff45\"><span data-lake-id=\"u099746d8\" id=\"u099746d8\">预处理的批操作</span></li></ol><ol list=\"u325f5a02\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"u0f455201\" data-lake-id=\"ub435efe7\" id=\"ub435efe7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6c11a8c6\" id=\"u6c11a8c6\">葡萄酒数据的预处理</span></li></ol><ol list=\"ua6bb33c1\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"u0bbb348c\" data-lake-id=\"u04d207ba\" id=\"u04d207ba\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7ffdcc10\" id=\"u7ffdcc10\">图像数据的预处理</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u0790e2be\" id=\"u0790e2be\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"36aedca7\" id=\"36aedca7\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub268647d\" id=\"ub268647d\">数据的预处理</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u115d38e9\" id=\"u115d38e9\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u724152c2\" id=\"u724152c2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0cf18c97\" id=\"u0cf18c97\">Compose</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7caae777\" id=\"u7caae777\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7b7f8011\" id=\"u7b7f8011\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2a444716\" id=\"u2a444716\">首先让我们先来学习torchvision.transforms.Compose(), 它的参数是一个由多个transforms包中的方法组成的列表. 简单的说, 该函数的主要目的就是将所有的预处理操作进行打包, 当有数据来时, 我们只需要将数据传入该函数中,就能一次性对数据进行所有预处理操作</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u94e4fc35\" id=\"u94e4fc35\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22import%20torch%5Cnimport%20torchvision%5Cn%5Cnclass%20ToTensor%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20__call__(self%2Cx)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20torch.from_numpy(x)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cnclass%20MulTransform%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20__call__(self%2Cx)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20x*%3D2%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20x%5Cn%5Cncomposed%20%3D%20torchvision.transforms.Compose(%5BToTensor()%2CMulTransform()%5D)%5Cnprint(composed)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%227df2ca18%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ue60e1485\" id=\"ue60e1485\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u32301264\" id=\"u32301264\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5acbbc5e\" id=\"u5acbbc5e\">上面我们定义了一个预处理的集合器, 我们只需要将数据传入composed中,PyTorch就会自动对数据进行ToTensor()和MulTransform()操作.</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5bc1f14c\" id=\"u5bc1f14c\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22import%20numpy%20as%20np%5Cndata%20%3D%20np.array(%5B1%2C2%2C3%5D)%5Cncomposed(data)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22e6f61d9c%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u9b0878c5\" id=\"u9b0878c5\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc8541dde\" id=\"uc8541dde\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1b6a3d39\" id=\"u1b6a3d39\">从结果可以看出, 尽管我们的数据需要进行很多次的预处理, 但是我们只需要将这些预处理全部放入Compose中进行打包,就能形成一个数据预处理结合.</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u58ca5677\" id=\"u58ca5677\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ubec6db28\" id=\"ubec6db28\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9afc065f\" id=\"u9afc065f\">当我们需要处理某些数据时, 只需要简单的将数据传入这个集合即可.</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ubb71459a\" id=\"ubb71459a\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5c8661a6\" id=\"u5c8661a6\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud1d3ff6a\" id=\"ud1d3ff6a\">接下来, 我们以葡萄酒的数据预处理为例,修改上一个实验的WineDataset类, 使其能够输出归一化后的Tensor数据集.</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3fb601fd\" id=\"u3fb601fd\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"bc0245af\" id=\"bc0245af\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5d3a1ccd\" id=\"u5d3a1ccd\">葡萄酒数据的预处理</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u533754c4\" id=\"u533754c4\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2b390964\" id=\"u2b390964\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue5e33214\" id=\"ue5e33214\">首先, 还是让我们先来定义数据集合:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2ff3112b\" id=\"u2ff3112b\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E5%B0%81%E8%A3%85%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AADataset%E7%B1%BB%5Cnfrom%20torch.utils.data%20import%20Dataset%5Cnimport%20pandas%20as%20pd%5Cnclass%20WineDataset(Dataset)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%BB%BA%E7%AB%8B%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E9%9B%86%E5%90%88%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BFDataset%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20__init__(self%2Ctransform)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%8A%A0%E8%BD%BDwine.csv%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20xy%20%3D%20pd.read_csv(%5C%22.%2Fwine.csv%5C%22)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%23%20%E9%87%87%E6%A0%B7%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.samples_num%20%3D%20xy.shape%5B0%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%B0%86pandas%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E8%BD%AC%E6%88%90tensor%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.datas%20%3D%20xy.values%5B%3A%2C1%3A%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.labels%20%3D%20xy.values%5B%3A%2C0%5D.reshape(-1%2C1)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%23%20%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E9%A2%84%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.transform%20%3D%20transform%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20__getitem__(self%2Cindex)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20sample%20%3D%20%20self.datas%5Bindex%5D%2Cself.labels%5Bindex%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20if%20self.transform%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20self.transform(sample)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20sample%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20__len__(self)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20self.samples_num%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%2270c9f4fc%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u71a47399\" id=\"u71a47399\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue2831e3c\" id=\"ue2831e3c\"><span data-lake-id=\"uef24da9d\" id=\"uef24da9d\">可以看出WineDataset类中的代码和上一个案例大致相同, 我们只是多加了一个transform变量,即数据预处理操作的集合. 该变量并没有在WineDataset类中被定义,只是作为一个参数被传入.</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ube83c9e1\" id=\"ube83c9e1\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub683e910\" id=\"ub683e910\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubc3e31f9\" id=\"ubc3e31f9\">这样做有一个好处就是, 当我们需要在原来基础上添加新的预处理操作时, 我们只需要在模型外重新定义transform变量即可. 无需修改原来类中的代码.</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u61556247\" id=\"u61556247\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub6a9ed86\" id=\"ub6a9ed86\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue881c19a\" id=\"ue881c19a\">接下来, 就让我们来定义预处理操作了.</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u46ab0886\" id=\"u46ab0886\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1506db44\" id=\"u1506db44\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0b24cb00\" id=\"u0b24cb00\">首先,让我们来定义数据归一化操作,我们这里使用最大最小归一化</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ucb3362f5\" id=\"ucb3362f5\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E4%B8%BA%E4%BA%86%E4%BE%BF%E4%BA%8E%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E5%B0%86%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E8%BF%9B%E8%A1%8C%E5%BD%92%E4%B8%80%E5%8C%96%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%5Cnclass%20Normalization%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20__call__(self%2Csample)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20inputs%2Ctargets%20%3D%20sample%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20amin%2Camax%20%3D%20inputs.min()%2Cinputs.max()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20inputs%20%3D%20(inputs%20-%20amin)%2F(amax%20-%20amin)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20inputs%2Ctargets%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%5Cna%20%3D%2010%20*%20np.random.random((5%2C5))%5Cnprint(a)%5Cn%23%20%E5%89%8D4%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8%E7%A4%BA%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E1%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8%E7%A4%BA%E6%A0%87%E7%AD%BE%5Cnasample%20%3D%20%5Ba%5B%3A%2C0%3A4%5D%2Ca%5B%3A%2C4%5D%5D%5CnNormalization()(asample)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%221387c9ad%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ub28ae562\" id=\"ub28ae562\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uabd4b8b9\" id=\"uabd4b8b9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud3ff3a55\" id=\"ud3ff3a55\">接下来, 让我们来定义数据的转化操作,即将原数据类型转为Tensor:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"udfb84202\" id=\"udfb84202\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22class%20ToTensor%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20__call__(self%2C%20sample)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20inputs%2C%20targets%20%3D%20sample%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20torch.from_numpy(inputs)%2Ctorch.from_numpy(targets)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%23%20%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%5Cna%20%3D%2010%20*%20np.random.random((5%2C5))%5Cn%23%20%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%2C%E5%89%8D4%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8%E7%A4%BA%E7%89%B9%E5%BE%81%2C%20%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E%E4%B8%80%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8%E7%A4%BA%E6%A0%87%E7%AD%BE%5Cndata%20%3D%20%5Ba%5B%3A%2C0%3A4%5D%2Ca%5B%3A%2C4%5D%5D%5CnToTensor()(data)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22a53ff6cc%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u952db756\" id=\"u952db756\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8165a9d6\" id=\"u8165a9d6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u31cea535\" id=\"u31cea535\">最后, 让我们使用这两个预处理的操作, 来处理葡萄酒数据.</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf1a36f45\" id=\"uf1a36f45\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9a7d974c\" id=\"u9a7d974c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2306969c\" id=\"u2306969c\">我们无需修改上面的代码, 只需将其封装到Compose中, 再传入即可.</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u02a05957\" id=\"u02a05957\"><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E%E6%97%A0%E9%9C%80%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E4%B8%8A%E9%9D%A2%E7%9A%84%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%91%E4%BB%AC%E5%B0%86%E5%85%B6%E5%B0%81%E8%A3%85%E5%88%B0compose%E4%B8%AD%5Cncomposed%20%3D%20torchvision.transforms.Compose(%5BNormalization()%2CToTensor()%5D)%5Cn%23%20%E4%BC%A0%E5%85%A5%E8%AF%A5%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%5CnwineData%20%3D%20WineDataset(transform%3Dcomposed)%5Cn%23%20%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%9D%A1%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%5Cnfeatures%2Clabels%20%3D%20wineData%5B0%5D%5Cn%23%20%E6%89%93%E5%8D%B0%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%5Cnprint(type(features)%2Ctype(labels))%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize